        {
          "source": "fda-furosemideinj",
          "section": "Pregnancy:"
        }
      ]
    },
    "lactation": {
      "level": "caution",
      "text": {
        "fa": "برچسب: در شیردهی با احتیاط؛ متن برچسب را ببینید.",
        "en": "Label: use with caution while breastfeeding; see the label text."
      },
      "quote": "Because it appears in breast milk, caution should be exercised when furosemide is administered to a nursing mother.",
      "refs": [
        {
          "source": "fda-furosemideinj",
          "section": "Nursing Mothers:"
        }
      ]
    },
    "pediatric": {
      "level": "caution",
      "text": {
        "fa": "برچسب برای کودکان شرط، محدودیت سنی یا نکته دارد؛ جمله برچسب در زیر آمده است.",
        "en": "The label has conditions, age limits or notes for children; the label sentence is quoted below."
      },
      "quote": "In premature neonates with respiratory distress syndrome, diuretic treatment with furosemide in the first few weeks of life may increase the risk of persistent patent ductus arteriosus (PDA), possibly through a prostaglandin-E-mediated process.",
      "refs": [
        {
          "source": "fda-furosemideinj",
          "section": "Pediatric Use:"
        }
      ]
    },
    "geriatric": {
      "level": "caution",
      "text": {
        "fa": "برچسب: در سالمندان با احتیاط و معمولاً از دوز پایین شروع شود.",
        "en": "Label: use with caution in older adults, usually starting at the low end of the dose range."
      },
      "quote": "In general, dose selection for the elderly patient should be cautious, usually starting at the low end of the dosing range, reflecting the greater frequency of decreased hepatic, renal or cardiac function and of concomitant disease or other drug therapy.",
